{"workspace_id":"25e29102-22b3-44ff-b70b-d2370125c179","revision":1,"source":"synthetic:alder/quickstart-1.8","title":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart","id":"ar-legacy","text":"Alder Relay 1.8 operator quickstart. Scope: release 1.8 only. A request may be attempted at most three times in total: the initial attempt and at most two retries. Only a transport timeout is retryable. HTTP 4xx responses are final and must not be retried. This document is not a policy for later major policy revisions.","version":1}